41418::$$$message_0295_0000_0000$$$::"This is Rider's swimsuit, as well as what she wears to work at the antique store."::
41419::$$$message_0295_0001_0000$$$::"I hardly need to mention her charming figure.[br]Sunglasses Ver. (center) was unused, but we left it in the assets."::
41420::$$$message_0295_0002_0000$$$::"She tried out my Mystic Eye-sealing contacts.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01a(中)] They're 24-hours disposable lenses, but the materials were easy enough to make."::
41421::$$$message_0295_0003_0000$$$::"I see.[br]Did you use crystal glass? Or perhaps quartz?"::
41422::$$$message_0295_0004_0000$$$::"Nope, emerald.[br]The uncut stones are a little quirky. They've been with a gem worker in Brugge for a long time, and I had them process it for me.::
41423::$$$message_0295_0005_0000$$$::"...Did you just say they're disposable?"::
